{"seq":2,"slug":"combinational-sequential-description","title":"组合与时序逻辑描述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/hdl-programming/combinational-sequential-description","wordCount":1427,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"组合与时序逻辑描述\">组合与时序逻辑描述</h1><p>数字电路分为两大类：组合逻辑（输出仅取决于当前输入）和时序逻辑（输出取决于当前输入和历史状态）。在 Verilog 中正确区分和描述这两类逻辑是编写可靠 RTL 代码的核心能力。本文详细介绍两者的描述范式、常见设计模式以及易错点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>组合逻辑与时序逻辑的分界，本质上是<strong>是否存在状态记忆</strong>：组合逻辑的输出是当前输入的纯函数，时序逻辑的输出还依赖上一次时钟沿锁存的历史状态。这条分界决定了 Verilog 的两套描述范式，也决定了几乎所有常见错误的根源——用错范式，或在一个范式里混入另一个范式的写法。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>组合逻辑</strong>用 <code>assign</code> 或 <code>always @(*)</code>，必须保证所有输入路径都有赋值，否则综合器会推断出锁存器（FPGA 中几乎总是错误信号）。</li>\n<li><strong>时序逻辑</strong>用 <code>always @(posedge clk)</code>，配合非阻塞赋值 <code>&lt;=</code> 描述触发器，复位方式（同步/异步）需按目标器件规范选择。</li>\n<li><strong>流水线</strong>用触发器切分过长的组合路径，以增加延迟换取更高工作频率。</li>\n<li><strong>FSM</strong> 是两类逻辑协作的典型：状态寄存器是时序的，下一状态与输出逻辑是组合的，三段式写法将三者显式分离。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"组合逻辑与时序逻辑的本质区别\">组合逻辑与时序逻辑的本质区别</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 组合逻辑&#10;        IN1[&quot;输入&quot;] --&gt; LOGIC1[&quot;逻辑门网络&quot;] --&gt; OUT1[&quot;输出&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 时序逻辑&#10;        IN2[&quot;输入&quot;] --&gt; LOGIC2[&quot;逻辑门网络&quot;] --&gt; FF[&quot;触发器&lt;br/&gt;D FF&quot;]&#10;        FF --&gt; OUT2[&quot;输出&quot;]&#10;        CLK[&quot;时钟&quot;] --&gt; FF&#10;        FF --&gt;|反馈| LOGIC2&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 组合逻辑\n        IN1[\"输入\"] --&gt; LOGIC1[\"逻辑门网络\"] --&gt; OUT1[\"输出\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 时序逻辑\n        IN2[\"输入\"] --&gt; LOGIC2[\"逻辑门网络\"] --&gt; FF[\"触发器&lt;br/&gt;D FF\"]\n        FF --&gt; OUT2[\"输出\"]\n        CLK[\"时钟\"] --&gt; FF\n        FF --&gt;|反馈| LOGIC2\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>组合逻辑</th>\n<th>时序逻辑</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输出依赖</td>\n<td>仅当前输入</td>\n<td>当前输入 + 历史状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储元件</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>触发器/锁存器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时钟</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>需要时钟边沿触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟特征</td>\n<td>传播延迟（透明）</td>\n<td>时钟到输出延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Verilog 描述</td>\n<td><code>assign</code> 或 <code>always @(*)</code></td>\n<td><code>always @(posedge clk)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬件综合结果</td>\n<td>LUT + 互联</td>\n<td>LUT + FF</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"组合逻辑描述\">组合逻辑描述</h2><h3 id=\"方法一-连续赋值-assign\">方法一：连续赋值（assign）</h3><p>适用于简单的组合逻辑表达式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 基本逻辑门&#10;assign and_out = a &amp; b;&#10;assign or_out  = a | b;&#10;assign xor_out = a ^ b;&#10;&#10;// 多路选择器&#10;assign mux4_out = sel[1] ? (sel[0] ? d3 : d2)&#10;                         : (sel[0] ? d1 : d0);&#10;&#10;// 译码器&#10;assign decode = 1&#39;b1 &lt;&lt; addr;  // 独热码译码&#10;&#10;// 优先级编码器&#10;assign priority = data[7] ? 3&#39;d7 :&#10;                  data[6] ? 3&#39;d6 :&#10;                  data[5] ? 3&#39;d5 :&#10;                  data[4] ? 3&#39;d4 :&#10;                  data[3] ? 3&#39;d3 :&#10;                  data[2] ? 3&#39;d2 :&#10;                  data[1] ? 3&#39;d1 : 3&#39;d0;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 基本逻辑门</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assign and_out = a &#x26; b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assign or_out  = a | b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assign xor_out = a ^ b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 多路选择器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assign mux4_out = sel[1] ? (sel[0] ? d3 : d2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                         : (sel[0] ? d1 : d0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 译码器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assign decode = 1'b1 &#x3C;&#x3C; addr;  // 独热码译码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 优先级编码器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assign priority = data[7] ? 3'd7 :</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  data[6] ? 3'd6 :</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  data[5] ? 3'd5 :</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  data[4] ? 3'd4 :</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  data[3] ? 3'd3 :</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  data[2] ? 3'd2 :</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  data[1] ? 3'd1 : 3'd0;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方法二-组合-always-块\">方法二：组合 always 块</h3><p>适用于复杂条件逻辑（多分支 if-else、case）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"reg [7:0] alu_result;&#10;&#10;always @(*) begin&#10;    case (op)&#10;        4&#39;b0000: alu_result = a + b;&#10;        4&#39;b0001: alu_result = a - b;&#10;        4&#39;b0010: alu_result = a &amp; b;&#10;        4&#39;b0011: alu_result = a | b;&#10;        4&#39;b0100: alu_result = a ^ b;&#10;        4&#39;b0101: alu_result = ~a;&#10;        4&#39;b0110: alu_result = a &lt;&lt; 1;&#10;        4&#39;b0111: alu_result = a &gt;&gt; 1;&#10;        default: alu_result = 8&#39;h00;&#10;    endcase&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>reg [7:0] alu_result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(*) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    case (op)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        4'b0000: alu_result = a + b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        4'b0001: alu_result = a - b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        4'b0010: alu_result = a &#x26; b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        4'b0011: alu_result = a | b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        4'b0100: alu_result = a ^ b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        4'b0101: alu_result = ~a;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        4'b0110: alu_result = a &#x3C;&#x3C; 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        4'b0111: alu_result = a >> 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        default: alu_result = 8'h00;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    endcase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"锁存器陷阱\">锁存器陷阱</h3><p>组合 always 块中最危险的错误是无意中推断出锁存器（Latch）。锁存器在 FPGA 中几乎总是设计错误的标志：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 错误：缺少 else 分支 → 推断锁存器&#10;always @(*) begin&#10;    if (en)&#10;        q = d;&#10;    // 当 en=0 时 q 需要&quot;保持&quot;→ 综合器推断锁存器&#10;end&#10;&#10;// 正确：所有路径都有赋值&#10;always @(*) begin&#10;    if (en)&#10;        q = d;&#10;    else&#10;        q = 1&#39;b0;  // 明确默认值&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 错误：缺少 else 分支 → 推断锁存器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(*) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (en)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        q = d;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 当 en=0 时 q 需要\"保持\"→ 综合器推断锁存器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 正确：所有路径都有赋值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(*) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (en)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        q = d;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        q = 1'b0;  // 明确默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>防止锁存器的三条规则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>always @(*)</code> 块中的每个信号在所有分支中都必须被赋值</li>\n<li><code>case</code> 语句必须有 <code>default</code> 分支</li>\n<li>在 always 块开头给所有输出信号赋默认值</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 推荐的安全模式：开头赋默认值&#10;always @(*) begin&#10;    next_state = IDLE;   // 默认值&#10;    data_out   = 8&#39;h00;  // 默认值&#10;&#10;    case (state)&#10;        IDLE: begin&#10;            if (start) next_state = RUN;&#10;        end&#10;        RUN: begin&#10;            next_state = RUN;&#10;            data_out = processed_data;&#10;            if (done) next_state = IDLE;&#10;        end&#10;    endcase&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 推荐的安全模式：开头赋默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(*) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    next_state = IDLE;   // 默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data_out   = 8'h00;  // 默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    case (state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        IDLE: begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (start) next_state = RUN;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        RUN: begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            next_state = RUN;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            data_out = processed_data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (done) next_state = IDLE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    endcase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"时序逻辑描述\">时序逻辑描述</h2><h3 id=\"基本触发器\">基本触发器</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// D 触发器（同步复位）&#10;always @(posedge clk) begin&#10;    if (rst)&#10;        q &lt;= 1&#39;b0;&#10;    else&#10;        q &lt;= d;&#10;end&#10;&#10;// D 触发器（异步复位）&#10;always @(posedge clk or posedge rst) begin&#10;    if (rst)&#10;        q &lt;= 1&#39;b0;&#10;    else&#10;        q &lt;= d;&#10;end&#10;&#10;// 带使能的 D 触发器&#10;always @(posedge clk) begin&#10;    if (rst)&#10;        q &lt;= 1&#39;b0;&#10;    else if (en)&#10;        q &lt;= d;&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// D 触发器（同步复位）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (rst)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        q &#x3C;= 1'b0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        q &#x3C;= d;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// D 触发器（异步复位）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk or posedge rst) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (rst)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        q &#x3C;= 1'b0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        q &#x3C;= d;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 带使能的 D 触发器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (rst)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        q &#x3C;= 1'b0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else if (en)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        q &#x3C;= d;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"同步复位-vs-异步复位\">同步复位 vs 异步复位</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>同步复位</th>\n<th>异步复位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>复位响应</td>\n<td>等待时钟边沿</td>\n<td>立即响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>敏感列表</td>\n<td><code>always @(posedge clk)</code></td>\n<td><code>always @(posedge clk or posedge rst)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源消耗</td>\n<td>占用 LUT 输入（增加逻辑层级）</td>\n<td>使用 FF 专用复位端口（零额外逻辑）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时序影响</td>\n<td>复位路径可能成为关键路径</td>\n<td>需满足恢复/移除时间约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FPGA 推荐</td>\n<td>Xilinx 7 系列推荐</td>\n<td>Intel FPGA 推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可靠性</td>\n<td>高（无亚稳态风险）</td>\n<td>需同步释放处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"计数器设计\">计数器设计</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 基本计数器&#10;reg [15:0] count;&#10;&#10;always @(posedge clk) begin&#10;    if (rst)&#10;        count &lt;= 16&#39;d0;&#10;    else if (count == 16&#39;d49999)&#10;        count &lt;= 16&#39;d0;   // 50000 分频&#10;    else&#10;        count &lt;= count + 1&#39;b1;&#10;end&#10;&#10;assign tick = (count == 16&#39;d49999);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 基本计数器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reg [15:0] count;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (rst)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        count &#x3C;= 16'd0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else if (count == 16'd49999)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        count &#x3C;= 16'd0;   // 50000 分频</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        count &#x3C;= count + 1'b1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assign tick = (count == 16'd49999);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"移位寄存器\">移位寄存器</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 串入并出（SIPO）移位寄存器&#10;reg [7:0] shift_reg;&#10;&#10;always @(posedge clk) begin&#10;    if (rst)&#10;        shift_reg &lt;= 8&#39;h00;&#10;    else if (shift_en)&#10;        shift_reg &lt;= {shift_reg[6:0], serial_in};&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 串入并出（SIPO）移位寄存器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reg [7:0] shift_reg;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (rst)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        shift_reg &#x3C;= 8'h00;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else if (shift_en)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        shift_reg &#x3C;= {shift_reg[6:0], serial_in};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"有限状态机-fsm\">有限状态机（FSM）</h2><p>FSM 是组合逻辑与时序逻辑协作的典型范例。推荐使用三段式描述法，将状态寄存器、下一状态逻辑和输出逻辑分离：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 三段式FSM&#10;        NS[&quot;下一状态逻辑&lt;br/&gt;(组合)&quot;] --&gt; SR[&quot;状态寄存器&lt;br/&gt;(时序)&quot;]&#10;        SR --&gt; OL[&quot;输出逻辑&lt;br/&gt;(组合)&quot;]&#10;        SR --&gt;|当前状态| NS&#10;        INPUT[&quot;输入信号&quot;] --&gt; NS&#10;        OL --&gt; OUTPUT[&quot;输出信号&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 三段式FSM\n        NS[\"下一状态逻辑&lt;br/&gt;(组合)\"] --&gt; SR[\"状态寄存器&lt;br/&gt;(时序)\"]\n        SR --&gt; OL[\"输出逻辑&lt;br/&gt;(组合)\"]\n        SR --&gt;|当前状态| NS\n        INPUT[\"输入信号\"] --&gt; NS\n        OL --&gt; OUTPUT[\"输出信号\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"三段式-fsm-代码模板\">三段式 FSM 代码模板</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 状态编码&#10;localparam IDLE = 3&#39;b001;&#10;localparam READ = 3&#39;b010;&#10;localparam DONE = 3&#39;b100;&#10;&#10;reg [2:0] state, next_state;&#10;&#10;// 第一段：状态寄存器（时序逻辑）&#10;always @(posedge clk) begin&#10;    if (rst)&#10;        state &lt;= IDLE;&#10;    else&#10;        state &lt;= next_state;&#10;end&#10;&#10;// 第二段：下一状态逻辑（组合逻辑）&#10;always @(*) begin&#10;    next_state = state;  // 默认保持&#10;    case (state)&#10;        IDLE: if (start)  next_state = READ;&#10;        READ: if (finish) next_state = DONE;&#10;        DONE:             next_state = IDLE;&#10;        default:          next_state = IDLE;&#10;    endcase&#10;end&#10;&#10;// 第三段：输出逻辑（组合逻辑）&#10;always @(*) begin&#10;    rd_en   = 1&#39;b0;&#10;    done_o  = 1&#39;b0;&#10;    case (state)&#10;        READ: rd_en  = 1&#39;b1;&#10;        DONE: done_o = 1&#39;b1;&#10;        default: ;&#10;    endcase&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 状态编码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>localparam IDLE = 3'b001;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>localparam READ = 3'b010;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>localparam DONE = 3'b100;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reg [2:0] state, next_state;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 第一段：状态寄存器（时序逻辑）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (rst)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        state &#x3C;= IDLE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        state &#x3C;= next_state;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 第二段：下一状态逻辑（组合逻辑）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(*) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    next_state = state;  // 默认保持</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    case (state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        IDLE: if (start)  next_state = READ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        READ: if (finish) next_state = DONE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        DONE:             next_state = IDLE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        default:          next_state = IDLE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    endcase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 第三段：输出逻辑（组合逻辑）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(*) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    rd_en   = 1'b0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    done_o  = 1'b0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    case (state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        READ: rd_en  = 1'b1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        DONE: done_o = 1'b1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        default: ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    endcase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"状态编码方式\">状态编码方式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码方式</th>\n<th>状态数 N 时的位宽</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>二进制编码</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil\\log_2 N\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最少 FF 使用</td>\n<td>译码逻辑复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格雷码</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil\\log_2 N\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>相邻状态仅 1-bit 变化</td>\n<td>仅适用于线性状态序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独热码（One-Hot）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>译码简单（1 个 FF 即可判断）</td>\n<td>FF 数量多</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 FPGA 中通常推荐<strong>独热码</strong>，因为 FPGA 的 FF 资源丰富但 LUT 资源相对紧张，独热码减少了组合逻辑深度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流水线设计\">流水线设计</h2><p>流水线是用时序逻辑拆分长组合路径、提升工作频率的核心技术：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 无流水线：组合路径过长&#10;assign result = ((a * b) + c) * d;  // 两级乘法 + 一级加法&#10;&#10;// 三级流水线&#10;reg [31:0] pipe1, pipe2, pipe3;&#10;reg [31:0] c_d1, d_d1, d_d2;&#10;&#10;always @(posedge clk) begin&#10;    // 第一级：乘法 a*b&#10;    pipe1 &lt;= a * b;&#10;    c_d1  &lt;= c;&#10;    d_d1  &lt;= d;&#10;&#10;    // 第二级：加法&#10;    pipe2 &lt;= pipe1 + c_d1;&#10;    d_d2  &lt;= d_d1;&#10;&#10;    // 第三级：乘法&#10;    pipe3 &lt;= pipe2 * d_d2;&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 无流水线：组合路径过长</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>assign result = ((a * b) + c) * d;  // 两级乘法 + 一级加法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 三级流水线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reg [31:0] pipe1, pipe2, pipe3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reg [31:0] c_d1, d_d1, d_d2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>always @(posedge clk) begin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 第一级：乘法 a*b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pipe1 &#x3C;= a * b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c_d1  &#x3C;= c;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    d_d1  &#x3C;= d;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 第二级：加法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pipe2 &#x3C;= pipe1 + c_d1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    d_d2  &#x3C;= d_d1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 第三级：乘法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pipe3 &#x3C;= pipe2 * d_d2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p>流水线的代价是增加了延迟（latency，以时钟周期计）和 FF 资源消耗，但吞吐量（throughput）保持每周期一个结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见错误总结\">常见错误总结</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>预防措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>组合 always 中遗漏分支</td>\n<td>推断锁存器</td>\n<td>开头赋默认值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时序 always 中用阻塞赋值</td>\n<td>仿真/综合不一致</td>\n<td>始终用 <code>&lt;=</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>敏感列表不完整</td>\n<td>仿真与硬件行为不同</td>\n<td>使用 <code>always @(*)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多驱动冲突</td>\n<td>综合错误或 X 态</td>\n<td>每个信号仅在一个 always 块或 assign 中赋值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合逻辑环路</td>\n<td>振荡或不确定行为</td>\n<td>确保信号无自身依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步复位未同步释放</td>\n<td>亚稳态风险</td>\n<td>使用异步复位同步释放电路</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>组合逻辑输出仅取决于当前输入（<code>assign</code> 或 <code>always @(*)</code>），时序逻辑输出还依赖历史状态（<code>always @(posedge clk)</code>）。</li>\n<li>组合 always 块中遗漏分支会推断出锁存器；三条防锁存规则是：所有分支都赋值、<code>case</code> 带 <code>default</code>、块首赋默认值。</li>\n<li>时序逻辑应使用非阻塞赋值 <code>&lt;=</code>；同步复位占用 LUT 输入但对 Xilinx 更友好，异步复位零额外逻辑但需同步释放处理。</li>\n<li>计数器、移位寄存器等基础时序电路都由&quot;复位 → 条件更新&quot;的 <code>always</code> 结构描述。</li>\n<li>三段式 FSM（状态寄存器 + 下一状态逻辑 + 输出逻辑）是最清晰的描述方式；FPGA 中通常推荐独热码编码。</li>\n<li>流水线通过插入触发器切分长组合路径提升频率，代价是延迟与 FF 资源增加，但吞吐量维持在每周期一个结果。</li>\n<li>常见错误集中在赋值方式、敏感列表完整性、多驱动和组合环路，编写时以&quot;对应什么硬件&quot;自检。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"组合与时序逻辑描述","id":"组合与时序逻辑描述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"组合逻辑与时序逻辑的本质区别","id":"组合逻辑与时序逻辑的本质区别"},{"level":2,"text":"组合逻辑描述","id":"组合逻辑描述"},{"level":3,"text":"方法一：连续赋值（assign）","id":"方法一-连续赋值-assign"},{"level":3,"text":"方法二：组合 always 块","id":"方法二-组合-always-块"},{"level":3,"text":"锁存器陷阱","id":"锁存器陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"时序逻辑描述","id":"时序逻辑描述"},{"level":3,"text":"基本触发器","id":"基本触发器"},{"level":3,"text":"同步复位 vs 异步复位","id":"同步复位-vs-异步复位"},{"level":3,"text":"计数器设计","id":"计数器设计"},{"level":3,"text":"移位寄存器","id":"移位寄存器"},{"level":2,"text":"有限状态机（FSM）","id":"有限状态机-fsm"},{"level":3,"text":"三段式 FSM 代码模板","id":"三段式-fsm-代码模板"},{"level":3,"text":"状态编码方式","id":"状态编码方式"},{"level":2,"text":"流水线设计","id":"流水线设计"},{"level":2,"text":"常见错误总结","id":"常见错误总结"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Verilog 基础语法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/hdl-programming/verilog-basics"},"next":{"title":"模块化与参数化设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/fpga-introduction/hdl-programming/modular-parameterized-design"}}